The pack: lending 0.6.0.
Its verbs, each a tool, with the JSON Schema of their arguments (a $reference such as $item.code names a non-secret field of a resolved slot, never a credential's secret: <redacted> person signs on):
- answerPrompt (tool lending_answer_prompt): {"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Answers the open prompt by pressing one of its buttons, then waits until the desk is ready again or asks its next question.","properties":{"choice":{"description":"The button's label, such as OK, Cancel, Yes or No; or a $reference to one.","type":"string"},"id":{"description":"Answer only if the open prompt has this id, such as unknown-item; or a $reference to one.","type":"string"}},"required":["choice"],"type":"object"}
- authorise (tool lending_authorise): {"additionalProperties":false,"description":"A supervisor authorises what the desk asked for with the supervisor-required prompt: answers it with OK, then enters the supervisor's code and password, which comes from credentials.yaml, each time waiting until the desk is ready again. If the desk refuses, its authorisation-failed prompt fails the step.","properties":{"staff":{"description":"The supervisor who authorises: a $reference to a slot that declares a credential (credential: <redacted> staff, key: code}), such as $assistant; never a staff member or a password written out.","pattern":"^\\$[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*$","type":"string"}},"required":["staff"],"type":"object"}
- deposit (tool lending_deposit): {"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Takes the deposit (the DEPOSIT key) and waits until the desk is ready again: with an amount, the deposit received, which must be at least the amount due; without one, exactly the amount due. A return hands its deposit back and takes no amount: write deposit: {}.","properties":{"amount":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"number"}],"description":"The deposit received: money as a decimal string, such as \"10.00\", or a number, or a $reference, such as $oracle.due.total."}},"type":"object"}
- enter (tool lending_enter): {"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Types a value into the desk's entry field and presses Enter, then waits until the desk is ready again: a staff code at sign-on, a barcode or an item code on a loan.","properties":{"value":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"number"},{"type":"boolean"}],"description":"The value to enter: text, a number, or a $reference, such as $assistant.code."}},"required":["value"],"type":"object"}
- expectPrompt (tool lending_expect_prompt): {"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Waits until the desk asks a question (a prompt), matched by its id or its text when given, and counts the question as expected; the step fails when none comes in time. Answer it next with answerPrompt, or with authorise for supervisor-required.","properties":{"id":{"description":"The prompt's id, such as supervisor-required, unknown-item or induction-check; or a $reference to one.","type":"string"},"text":{"description":"The prompt's text, such as \"Unknown item\"; or a $reference to one.","type":"string"},"within":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"pattern":"^\\s*(\\d{1,15}|\\d{1,12}\\s*([Mm][Ss]|[Ss]|[Mm]))\\s*$","type":"string"}],"description":"How long to wait: a duration such as \"10s\" or \"500ms\", or a number of milliseconds; at most 119 s; the step timeout when left out."}},"type":"object"}
- key (tool lending_key): {"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Presses a key of the desk's keypad, with a value when one is given, and waits until the desk is ready again.","properties":{"action":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["DUE","DEPOSIT","RETURN","CANCEL","SIGN_OFF","QTY"],"type":"string"},{"pattern":"^\\$[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\.[A-Za-z0-9_]+$","type":"string"}],"description":"The key: DUE (the deposit due), DEPOSIT (the deposit received), RETURN (return mode), CANCEL (cancel the open loan), SIGN_OFF, or QTY (the quantity of the next item); or a $reference into an ActionKey slot, such as $keys.RETURN, which also checks that the key is on the keypad."},"value":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"number"},{"type":"boolean"}],"description":"A value sent with the key, as if typed before pressing it: text, a number, or a $reference."}},"required":["action"],"type":"object"}
- quantity (tool lending_quantity): {"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Sets the quantity of the next item scanned (the QTY key with the quantity): units of an item counted in units, or days of an item lent by the day.","properties":{"n":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"description":"a $reference to a slot, an oracle or $env","pattern":"^\\$[A-Za-z_]","type":"string"}],"description":"The quantity: a number of units or days (up to three decimals), or a $reference to one, such as $oracle.needed.qty."}},"required":["n"],"type":"object"}
- scan (tool lending_scan): {"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Scans an item: one barcode per unit, each time waiting until the desk is ready again or asks a question (unknown-item, item-not-for-loan, induction-check, supervisor-required, ...; expect it with expectPrompt). Give exactly one of item and barcode.","properties":{"barcode":{"description":"The barcode to send, quoted, such as \"5000000000017\", or a $reference to one, such as $item.barcode.","type":"string"},"item":{"anyOf":[{"description":"a $reference to a slot, an oracle or $env","pattern":"^\\$[A-Za-z_]","type":"string"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"barcode":{"description":"What scanning the item sends.","type":"string"},"code":{"description":"The item's code.","type":"string"},"deposit":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"number"}],"description":"The deposit for one unit or one day."},"title":{"description":"The item's name as the slip prints it.","type":"string"}},"required":["barcode"],"type":"object"}],"description":"The item to scan, whose barcode is sent: an item ({code, barcode, title, deposit}, at least its barcode) or a $reference to an item slot, such as $item."},"times":{"description":"How many units to scan, from 1 to 99; 1 when left out.","type":"integer"}},"type":"object"}
- signOff (tool lending_sign_off): {"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Signs the signed-on staff member off (the SIGN_OFF key) and waits until the desk is ready again. Takes no arguments: write signOff: {}.","properties":{},"type":"object"}
- signOn (tool lending_sign_on): {"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Signs a staff member on at the desk: enters their code, then their password, which comes from credentials.yaml and never from the scenario, each time waiting until the desk is ready again. A scenario that passes signs off again at its end.","properties":{"staff":{"description":"The staff member to sign on: a $reference to a slot that declares a credential (credential: <redacted> staff, key: code}), such as $assistant; never a staff member or a password written out.","pattern":"^\\$[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*$","type":"string"}},"required":["staff"],"type":"object"}
